QUAE IN HOC TOMO CONTINENTUR.</HEAD> <LIST COM="1277"><CAPTION COM="1277"><HI REND="ITALIC">INNOCENTIUS III ROMANUS PONTIFEX.</HI> REGESTORUM SIVE EPISTOLARUM LIBER DUODECIMUS.</CAPTION> <CAPTION COM="1277"> —  <HI REND="ITALIC">Pontificatus anno</HI>  XII,  <HI REND="ITALIC">Christi</HI>  1209.</CAPTION> <ITEM>I. — Abbati Sancti Theodorici Remensis dioecesis et
